{"artifact_id": "EXM-05", "chunk_id": "EXM-05:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "fc5397c20ce4a0e19a4a30df427d9595fe0644cc7819f2510e8626a51ee1ab6e", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-05", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "# EXM-05 — Question-Specific Examiner Insights"}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-05", "chunk_id": "EXM-05:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "6d86971ceb199d85e421e5ff897a89237f2c4c44fc295ea466b21378f3862022", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-05", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Purpose\n\nThis artifact collects the examiner reports' question-specific insights for 4CH1, as\nheld in the corpus of record (SRC-ER-4CH1): what individual questions and parts\nactually tested, where candidates succeeded, and where they failed — anchored\nquestion-by-question with paper/session identity. Every claim is carried on a\nbounded, page-located excerpt from the run's evidence pack. Research artifact;\ncanonical planes untouched."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-05", "chunk_id": "EXM-05:sec:SCOPE", "content_sha256": "676f1d8a2b29d0ea8e05db43a2a9cfc9d5adcff5217d9abb7e91cb10b1519259", "heading": "Scope", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-05", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Scope\n\n**Covers:** per-question insights on the 2019-06 papers of the pack — particle\nlabelling, mass-number deduction, particle-description demands, the oxygen test,\ndisplacement reasoning and the stem-repeat ruling.\n\n**Grounding:** SRC-ER-4CH1 (the 2019-06 1C/1CR/2C/2CR reports) with paper-identity\nheaders from SRC-QPMS-4CH1.\n\n**Out of scope:** general technique advice (EXM-06), warning/reward catalogues\n(EXM-02/EXM-03)."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-05", "chunk_id": "EXM-05:sec:EXECUTIVE_SUMMARY", "content_sha256": "6e7521df84953a6ef16987e443b73e60889c28494a3f5afc4de81788ac434899", "heading": "Executive Summary", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-05", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Executive Summary\n\nThe report commentary works at part granularity. On the 2019-06 papers it records:\nthe atom-labelling opener succeeded because the particle names were given in a box,\nyet a minority confused protons with neutrons; the mass-number part demanded\ndeduction from a diagram; the solid-particle description paid two marks for\narrangement-plus-movement; the oxygen test failed on reagent choice (splints); the\ndisplacement explanation failed on the missing causal link; and the group-similarity\npart was ruled not creditworthy when answered by repeating the stem. Each insight is\na teaching note written by the board itself."}
