{"artifact_id": "EXM-05", "chunk_id": "EXM-05:sec:EVIDENCE_SOURCE_BASIS", "content_sha256": "69fa8f63b0b2b9b08bd9ed3a2fa840f8d30452598770e925c95e4b1c3ccbdc29", "heading": "Evidence / Source Basis", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-05", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Evidence / Source Basis\n\nPrimary evidence: SRC-ER-4CH1 — the 2019-06 1C/1CR/2C/2CR examiner-report PDFs\n(page-located excerpts from the commentary zone; per-file identity carried by the\npaper-dir paths); SRC-QPMS-4CH1 supplies the papers' own question headers in the\npack for cross-reference. Two quotation windows truncate mid-sentence at the excerpt\ncap; the unexcerpted continuations are not paraphrased. No mark schemes were\nconsumed for insight claims."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-05", "chunk_id": "EXM-05:sec:LIMITATIONS_COVERAGE_GAPS", "content_sha256": "039e5bf27c15699273f13c5a044b625e1b2ee9ff78a734b3335d5e032f7c7277", "heading": "Limitations / Coverage Gaps", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-05", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Limitations / Coverage Gaps\n\nThe question-specific insights cover the pack's 2019-06 reports; the corpus's later\nheld sessions (2022-2025) are analysed only where sibling packs carry them. Sessions\nwithout public ERs remain source gaps of record. No canonical planes were written."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-05", "chunk_id": "EXM-05:sec:RESEARCH_STATUS", "content_sha256": "8aad38ee4b372ccb57a21fad95e355eda2592d03b381174895f58586e388585c", "heading": "Research Status", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-05", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Research Status\n\nGENERATED under SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005 (BL-008 pass 5) from the run's evidence\npack alone; validator of record tools/sib @ 357ace0a; claim QA r3 bound all citations\nto pack excerpts. Research artifact — evidence-backed, not canonical educational\ntruth."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-05", "chunk_id": "EXM-05:rec:EXM-022", "content_sha256": "09d8404870ddbe5bbc93be3f6b909d3c75f3083fa02de747b2eac5de1a32a75f", "heading": "EXM-022", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-05", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-022", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-022", "text": "### EXM-022 — Atom labelling: box-supported success, proton/neutron confusion\n\n**Claim:** the opening labelling part succeeded broadly because names were supplied,\nbut particle confusion persisted in a minority.\n**Evidence:** \"Question 1 (a) As anticipated, the great majority of candidates were\nable to correctly label the diagram of an atom using the names of some particles\nwhich were given in the box. A small minority confused protons and neutrons in the\nnucleus.\" (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-2C/er.pdf p4).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-05", "chunk_id": "EXM-05:rec:EXM-023", "content_sha256": "5b253e662e36b207652846f1ea6d1f53c788203f7f87609acdacf4ae8fe038e5", "heading": "EXM-023", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-05", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-023", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-023", "text": "### EXM-023 — Mass-number deduction from a diagram\n\n**Claim:** the follow-on part demanded deduction, not recall.\n**Evidence:** \"Question 1 (b) Candidates had to deduce the mass number of the atom\nfrom the...\" — the 2C report's part note (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-2C/er.pdf p4).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-05", "chunk_id": "EXM-05:rec:EXM-024", "content_sha256": "0b73bbec90cdd1e406b648ab6b22025512b168eb9cdba3e6dcc8b40c118691fc", "heading": "EXM-024", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-05", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-024", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-024", "text": "### EXM-024 — The solid-particle description demand\n\n**Claim:** the 1CR opening description part paid for arrangement AND movement, with\nmost candidates banking at least two marks.\n**Evidence:** \"In (b) the question specifically asked for a description of the\narrangement and movement of particles in a solid. Most candidates were able to score\nat least two marks with many...\" (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1CR/er.pdf p3).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-05", "chunk_id": "EXM-05:rec:EXM-025", "content_sha256": "89b62ec57f928b8bdafdb8aca9c7eea4181f50774a1a53cf80fae21635ab9fd2", "heading": "EXM-025", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-05", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-025", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-025", "text": "### EXM-025 — The oxygen test: reagent choice is the discriminator\n\n**Claim:** the gas-test part was lost on reagent choice, not on knowledge of gases.\n**Evidence:** \"Part (a) was very well answered by the majority of candidates, but\nsome lost the mark in (b) for using a lighted or unlit splint to test for oxygen.\"\n(SRC-ER-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-2CR/er.pdf p3).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-05", "chunk_id": "EXM-05:rec:EXM-026", "content_sha256": "ad2655027d40dd6d87568e5e970ae90fd9688d1d78c53face2470d94fd106ccb", "heading": "EXM-026", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-05", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-026", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-026", "text": "### EXM-026 — Displacement: observation without mechanism\n\n**Claim:** the halogen-displacement part separated candidates who linked the\nreactivity cause from those who only named the product.\n**Evidence:** \"Some knew bromine was formed but failed to explain that this was\nbecause chlorine is more reactive than bromine. A number of candidates, despite\nnoting correctly that bromine was formed, attributed the or...\" (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-2CR/er.pdf p4).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-05", "chunk_id": "EXM-05:rec:EXM-027", "content_sha256": "f9b342eda4f9ed8cb42e93726d17706fbf806935d9873bbf398bc8b28d651a26", "heading": "EXM-027", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-05", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-027", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-027", "text": "### EXM-027 — The stem-repeat ruling on the group-similarity part\n\n**Claim:** the 1C group-similarity part was ruled not creditworthy for stem\nrepetition.\n**Evidence:** \"Those who did not score here often just stated that the elements were\nin the same group, which was just a repeat of the stem of the question and is,\ntherefore, not creditworthy.\" (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/er.pdf p4).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
